      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the figure from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/02/F2_Savita_SSC_20-2-24_D1_V2.png\" style=\"width: 397px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n",
