        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Here, we can see that the given figure is moving in clockwise direction.</p>\n\n<p>Given:&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/02/F2_Savita_SSC_20-2-24_D3_V2.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 396px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>In the 1st figure the arrow is bottom left facing left, next it is at top left facing top.</p>\n\n<p>Similarly seeing this, the missing image will be same as the 1st figure given.</p>\n\n<p>First, we will check all the options:</p>\n\n<p>We see that, the next figure will have the arrow at the bottom left and so option 4 is eliminated.</p>\n\n<p>Next, we see that the rectangle image will be in horizontal direction and so option 3 is eliminated.</p>\n\n<p>Again, we see that, the black part is on top and so option 1 is eliminated.</p>\n\n<p>Thus, we are left with option 2&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Savita_SSC_03-10-22_D83.png\" style=\" width: 82px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <u><strong>option 2</strong></u>.</p>\n",
