      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The figure that will replace the question mark (?) in the following figure series is shown below:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1)&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">For &#39;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage664cac1c9c2a98e316be4a0a.png\" />&#39;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">element :&nbsp;</span>Shifting one position forward and backward&nbsp;subsequently.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/06/F1_SSC_Savita_29-5-24_D16.png\" style=\"width: 397px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2)&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">For &#39;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage664cac1d9c2a98e316be4a11.png\" />&#39;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;element :&nbsp;</span>Shifting to corner positions in clockwise direction subsequently.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/06/F1_SSC_Savita_29-5-24_D17.png\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">3)&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">For &#39;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage664cac1e9c2a98e316be4a18.png\" />&#39;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;element :</span>&nbsp;Alternately <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">&#39;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage664cac1e9c2a98e316be4a18.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;<b>&nbsp;</b></span>element is replaced by &#39;<img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage664cac1e9c2a98e316be4a1c.png\" />&#39; along with shifting in the clockwise direction from center to bottom and back to center.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/06/F1_SSC_Savita_29-5-24_D18.png\" style=\"width: 397px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">4)&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">For &#39;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage664cac1f9c2a98e316be4a21.png\" />&#39; <strong>element :</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Shifting in the clockwise direction along with skipping positions in an increasing order.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/06/F1_SSC_Savita_29-5-24_D19.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 399px; height: 173px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Final series is :</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/06/F1_SSC_Savita_29-5-24_D20.png\" style=\"width: 397px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&lsquo;Option - (4)&rsquo;</span>&nbsp;is the correct answer.</p>\n",
